      "type": "llm",
      "condition": { "input": "grade_level", "in": ["3", "4"] },
      "description": "Grades 3-4. Stage 1: LLM performs a sentence-by-sentence grammatical analysis (sentence types, clauses, phrases, transitions) of the input text, using ground_truth_counts as a computational reference.",
